// Same-build A/B, paired with measure-z1-ordinary-raw.ron: what the apex
// species itself is worth, isolated from the escort and the depth
// multiplier. `opponents:` always stages with `boss: false` and
// `depth_mult: 1.0` (see `arena::setup::build_opponents`), so both files in
// this pair are missing the underground depth multiplier a real Lair fight
// would apply — that makes both sides equally soft, which is what keeps
// the A vs B delta meaningful even though neither absolute number matches
// the real encounter. A level-1, zone-1, ungeared, partyless player is the
// same worst case as measure-z1d2-lair-fresh-mainframe.ron.
(
    player: Fresh(level: 1, zone: 1),
    opponents: [(species: "overseer", count: 1)],
    reps: 200,
    seed: 5007,
)
